Weaponless conduct

    * Never wield and hit with any of the following: 1) anything in the
    "weapons" category in your inventory; 2) a pickaxe; 3) a unicorn horn;
    4) a grappling hook (applying it is okay).

    * In 3.4.0 or later, do not apply polearms or lances.

    * Hitting with anything else (a lamp you just #rubbed and forgot to
    unwield, for instance, or a cockatrice corpse) does not break
    weaponless conduct.

